    "gm_notes": "<p>This massive arachnid is about the size of a human hand and capable of leaping from the ground, wall, or ceiling onto a victim. They are incredibly aggressive hunters that tend to ambush anyone that comes near. This beast was built by selecting a CR 1 Insect (bite attack), the venomous and spider climb abilities to create an arachnid. Then the standing leap ability was chosen to make sudden attacks and to make the creature CR 2.</p><p>Example beast, Core Rulebook pp.314-317.</p>",
